{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-6-2","kind":"proposition","title":"平行截线定理及其逆命题","englishTitle":"If a straight line be drawn parallel to one of the sides of a triangle, it will cut the sides of the triangle proportionally; and, if the sides of the triangle be cut proportionally, the line joining the points of section will be parallel to the remaining side of the triangle.","book":6,"number":2,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.2","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.2/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":2,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-6-2@raw-295a269b425f7710","contentId":"euclid-6-2","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"295a269b425f77103579eb2ccb8263c3985b964a5f4e8adaeda4565dad5147a5","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-6-2.statement","euclid-6-2.construction.1","euclid-6-2.construction.2","euclid-6-2.proof.1","euclid-6-2.proof.2","euclid-6-2.proof.3","euclid-6-2.proof.4","euclid-6-2.proof.5","euclid-6-2.proof.6","euclid-6-2.proof.7","euclid-6-2.proof.8","euclid-6-2.proof.9","euclid-6-2.proof.10","euclid-6-2.proof.11","euclid-6-2.proof.12","euclid-6-2.proof.13","euclid-6-2.conclusion","euclid-6-2.historical.1","euclid-6-2.historical.2","euclid-6-2.historical.3","euclid-6-2.historical.4","euclid-6-2.historical.5","euclid-6-2.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-6-2.statement","contentId":"euclid-6-2","revisionId":"euclid-6-2@raw-295a269b425f7710","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eb973478e0499ef8d70818d512f6f40d02578e153891c5a5c59deb9cd08c1bb2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a straight line be drawn parallel to one of the sides of a triangle, it will cut the sides of the triangle proportionally; and, if the sides of the triangle be cut proportionally, the line joining the points of section will be parallel to the remaining side of the triangle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果直线与三角形的侧面平行,则会按比例切开三角形的侧面;如果三角形的侧面按比例切开,连接区域点的线将同三角形的侧面平行。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"三角形任依一边作平行线即此线分两馀边以为比例必等三角形内有一线分两边以为比例而等即此线与馀边为平行"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一个三角形的某条边是平行的，则该线被分为两个余数，按比例分配并且必须相等。如果三角形中有一条线，两个边被认为是按比例且相等的，即这条线平行于余数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-2.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-6-2","revisionId":"euclid-6-2@raw-295a269b425f7710","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b71e2206d66fe0432905de8bd704dddb39e61482832eed743a940b0867cd626d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let DE be drawn parallel to BC, one of the sides of the triangle ABC; I say that, as BD is to DA, so is CE to EA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DE比BC,三角ABC的一边;我说,BD比DA等于CE比EA；BD 与 DA 之比等于 CE 与 EA 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-2.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-6-2","revisionId":"euclid-6-2@raw-295a269b425f7710","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9fefd69610f94867ca36a72a65aea099f14f9ee902d481d6a44ff3edef78ef5f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let BE, CD be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BE,CD连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-2.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-6-2","revisionId":"euclid-6-2@raw-295a269b425f7710","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6699f511ab8b05154c8077d295530983fa4dd533cf84bab4db1c67958559e976","citations":["euclid-1-38"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the triangle BDE is equal to the triangle CDE; for they are on the same base DE and in the same parallels DE, BC. [[I. 38](/principles/euclid-1-38)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,三角形BDE等于三角形CDE;因为三角形在底边 DE上,平行线为DE BC。 [[I. 38](/principles/euclid-1-38)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-2.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-6-2","revisionId":"euclid-6-2@raw-295a269b425f7710","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"af06a3f05af5ab009e5933fa3f6135441196296da4774d3c55cb9e86162f6e23","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the triangle ADE is another area."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"三角形ADE是另一个区域。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-2.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-6-2","revisionId":"euclid-6-2@raw-295a269b425f7710","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"31f4a5fa2a493ae0ddd03e8d5f38e095f55a581a11e3bae3b0b8b7d975f27744","citations":["euclid-5-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But equals have the same ratio to the same; [[V. 7](/principles/euclid-5-7)] therefore, as the triangle BDE is to the triangle ADE, so is the triangle CDE to the triangle ADE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但等值的比重相同;因此,三角BDE对三角ADE的比等于三角CDE对三角ADE的比；BDE 与 ADE 之比等于 CDE 与 ADE 之比。 [[V. 7](/principles/euclid-5-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-2.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-6-2","revisionId":"euclid-6-2@raw-295a269b425f7710","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1ea77fdd599a5320a6818cf4146b13f40da44c4bcda5d2824e3578c909ada9e7","citations":["euclid-6-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as the triangle BDE is to ADE, so is BD to DA; for, being under the same height, the perpendicular drawn from E to AB, they are to one another as their bases. [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,三角形BDE比ADE的比例等于BD比DA;由于身高相同,直径从E比AB,它们彼此是底边；BDE 与 ADE 之比等于 BD 与 DA 之比。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-2.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-6-2","revisionId":"euclid-6-2@raw-295a269b425f7710","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4e8d7dcf98b14b8e79a9b9304d07148085970d0de7f746d07d5f344976db4f2c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason also, as the triangle CDE is to ADE, so is CE to EA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,三角形CDE对ADE的比等于CE对EA的比；CDE 与 ADE 之比等于 CE 与 EA 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-2.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-6-2","revisionId":"euclid-6-2@raw-295a269b425f7710","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a321d60d032ab3bed0f0428c582b5654608dc1727abd3f16b00854dd8407d775","citations":["euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore also, as BD is to DA, so is CE to EA. [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BD比DA的比例也等于CE比EA；BD 与 DA 之比等于 CE 与 EA 之比。 [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-2.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-6-2","revisionId":"euclid-6-2@raw-295a269b425f7710","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"11ccd85495a199e6dc5847c4a14eb5673894e2a3aeb47c13b97ea345859f8471","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, let the sides AB, AC of the triangle ABC be cut proportionally, so that, as BD is to DA, so is CE to EA; and let DE be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"再一次,三角形ABC的AB、AC两边按比例削减,这样BD对DA的比例等于CE对EA的比例;DE对DE的连接；BD 与 DA 之比等于 CE 与 EA 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-2.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-6-2","revisionId":"euclid-6-2@raw-295a269b425f7710","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ad6479860fb2f57cf02d4cc5753ed9daa8a005a006f2df42848609a3781422bb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that DE is parallel to BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说DE是BC的平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-2.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-6-2","revisionId":"euclid-6-2@raw-295a269b425f7710","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"621cd62d5b4aa590a9ed08606ccde48d98777a08b82b0172cf3a30c09770372f","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, with the same construction, since, as BD is to DA, so is CE to EA, but, as BD is to DA, so is the triangle BDE to the triangle ADE, and, as CE is to EA, so is the triangle CDE to the triangle ADE, [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore also, as the triangle BDE is to the triangle ADE, so is the triangle CDE to the triangle ADE. [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样的构造,BD对DA的比等于CE对EA,BD对DA的比等于BDE对ADE三角的比,CE对EA的比等于CDE对ADE三角的比,因此,BDE对ADE三角的比也等于CDE对ADE三角的比；BD 与 DA 之比等于 CE 与 EA 之比；BD 与 DA 之比等于 BDE 与 ADE 之比；CE 与 EA 之比等于 CDE 与 ADE 之比；BDE 与 ADE 之比等于 CDE 与 ADE 之比。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-2.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-6-2","revisionId":"euclid-6-2@raw-295a269b425f7710","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"deab2c492ec4b829cb890a6c5d14f5fd6c5295a6aa6f59a6df74f54636e53018","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore each of the triangles BDE, CDE has the same ratio to ADE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BDE,CDE三角形的每个三角形比与ADE相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-2.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-6-2","revisionId":"euclid-6-2@raw-295a269b425f7710","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"efa8d579e9850dd6827480043c2ca6ec8f19dd92620d00ac5551170509ccb656","citations":["euclid-5-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the triangle BDE is equal to the triangle CDE; [[V. 9](/principles/euclid-5-9)] and they are on the same base DE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此三角形BDE等于三角形CDE; 三角形底边 DE相同。 [[V. 9](/principles/euclid-5-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-2.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-6-2","revisionId":"euclid-6-2@raw-295a269b425f7710","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1a46827dbafe7e40d0eb39f5d10bf7478764b48f957ad04ac47bb2d5a8908f46","citations":["euclid-1-39"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But equal triangles which are on the same base are also in the same parallels. [[I. 39](/principles/euclid-1-39)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但相同的底边三角形 也处于相同的平行状态 [[I. 39](/principles/euclid-1-39)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-2.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-6-2","revisionId":"euclid-6-2@raw-295a269b425f7710","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"96baa8e853818b24af99636658f5de0ed47bfd433cf316fcac761e9317845879","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore DE is parallel to BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,DE项与BC项平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-2.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-6-2","revisionId":"euclid-6-2@raw-295a269b425f7710","order":16,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-2.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-6-2","revisionId":"euclid-6-2@raw-295a269b425f7710","order":17,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b64667bc2006522ad547aa7292ab2f82f92a5810a2dfc6eabde592079c526772","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"三角形任依一边作平行线即此线分两馀边以为比例必等三角形内有一线分两边以为比例而等即此线与馀边为平行"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一个三角形的某条边是平行的，则该线被分为两个余数，按比例分配并且必须相等。如果三角形中有一条线，两个边被认为是按比例且相等的，即这条线平行于余数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-2.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-6-2","revisionId":"euclid-6-2@raw-295a269b425f7710","order":18,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3ee6b7159505eb19707ac569aea7fdfb324f2ad329fa46fedfd84faef83c90b3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"先解曰：甲乙丙角形内如作丁戊线与乙丙平行题言丁戊分甲乙甲丙于丁于戊以为比例必等者甲丁与丁乙若甲戊与戊丙也"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先，解释如下：甲乙丙 三角形，如果 丁戊 平行于 乙丙，则命题 丁戊 被分为 甲乙甲丙 和 丁 到 戊，因此比例必须相等。如果 甲丁 和 丁乙 是 甲戊 和 戊丙，"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-2.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-6-2","revisionId":"euclid-6-2@raw-295a269b425f7710","order":19,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f6555ccc198f8d3870427df5eebd2a9825d5d9ecf14866e2fc9d6c7563a0fd2a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试作丁丙戊乙两线其丁戊乙丁戊丙两角形同以丁戊为底同在两平行线内即等〈一卷三七〉而甲戊丁与丁戊乙两角形之比例若甲戊丁与丁戊丙矣〈五卷〉〈七〉夫甲戊丁与丁戊乙两角形亦在两平行线内〈若干〉〈戊点上作一线与甲乙平行即两形在其内〉则甲戊丁与丁戊乙两角形之比例若甲丁与丁乙两底也〈本篇一〉依显甲戊与戊丙两底之比例亦若甲戊丁与丁戊丙两角形也〈两形〉〈亦在两平行线内故〉是甲丁与丁乙两线之比例甲戊与戊丙两线之比例皆若甲戊丁与丁戊乙也或与丁戊丙也〈丁戊乙与丁戊丙等〉则甲丁与丁乙亦若甲戊与戊丙也〈五卷〉〈十一〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明：通过实验绘制线 丁丙戊乙 和 丁丙戊乙，三角形 丁戊乙丁戊丙 都以 丁戊 为基底，并位于两条平行线之间，即 〈一卷三七〉。三角形 甲戊丁 与 丁戊乙 的比类似于 甲戊丁 和 丁戊丙 〈五卷〉〈七〉。由于 甲戊丁 和 丁戊乙 也位于两条平行线 〈若干〉〈戊点上作一线与甲乙平行即两形在其内〉 之间，因此三角形 甲戊丁 与 丁戊乙 的比类似于 甲丁 和 丁乙 的底边，因此 甲丁 和 丁乙 的底边也是如此。〈本篇一〉 显示了底边 甲戊 和 戊丙 的比例，类似于三角形 甲戊丁 和 丁戊丙 〈两形〉〈亦在两平行线内故〉，即线 甲丁 和 丁乙 的比，以及线 甲戊 和 戊丙 的比例与 甲戊丁 和 丁戊乙 相称，或 丁戊丙。〈丁戊乙与丁戊丙等〉，然后 甲丁 和 丁乙 类似于 甲戊 和 戊丙 〈五卷〉〈十一〉"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-2.historical.4","contentId":"euclid-6-2","revisionId":"euclid-6-2@raw-295a269b425f7710","order":20,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a355132f207b95667816558ed74f8815ad020a6a8f4e37f2ec2cb467081dcedf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"后解曰：甲乙丙角形内有丁戊线分甲乙甲丙于丁于戊以为比例而等题言丁戊与乙丙为平行线"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其解释如下：甲乙丙 三角形，有一条线 丁戊 在 甲乙甲丙 处被 丁 和 戊 等比例地分开。命题解释：丁戊 和 乙丙 是平行线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-2.historical.5","contentId":"euclid-6-2","revisionId":"euclid-6-2@raw-295a269b425f7710","order":21,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6287b10afc3e1da4ab2450bd6b9b78a3d9dbed7273c58d99edd7980204670830","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试作丁丙戊乙两线其甲丁与丁乙两底之比例若甲戊丁与丁戊乙两角形也〈在两平行线内故见本篇一〉而甲丁与丁乙之比例若甲戊与戊丙即甲戊丁与丁戊乙之比例亦若甲戊与戊丙也〈五卷十一〉又甲戊与戊丙两底之比例既若甲戊丁与丁戊丙〈在两平行线内故见本篇〉〈一〉则甲戊丁与丁戊乙之比例亦若甲戊丁与丁戊丙也〈五卷十一〉而丁戊乙与丁戊丙两角形等矣〈五卷九〉两角形同以丁戊为底而等则在两平行线内〈一卷卅九〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：画两条线 丁丙戊乙，以及 甲丁 和 丁乙 底边的比例。如果 甲戊丁 和 丁戊乙 是三角形，〈在两平行线内故见本篇一〉 和 甲丁 成比例。如果 甲戊 是 戊丙，即 甲戊丁 和 丁戊乙，并且 甲戊 是 戊丙。〈五卷十一〉 和 甲戊 及 戊丙 具有底边比例。如果 甲戊丁 是 丁戊丙〈在两平行线内故见本篇〉〈一〉，则 甲戊丁 与 丁戊乙 的比例与 甲戊丁 和 丁戊丙 相同。〈五卷十一〉 和 丁戊丙 是等三角形。〈五卷九〉 和两个三角形都以 丁戊 为基础并且相等，因此 〈一卷卅九〉 位于两条平行线之间。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-2.source","contentId":"euclid-6-2","revisionId":"euclid-6-2@raw-295a269b425f7710","order":22,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9db4ea0f9db852456deec0f65f52076cc7959959939b6b8e54112d804b378576","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.2/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:g